  "title": {
    "rendered": "ህክምና"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">ዛሬ ታህሳስ 24/2014 ዓም በዘውዲቱ መሸሻ የህጻናትና ቤተሰብ መልጃ ማዕከል ውስጥ ከቅዱስ ጴጥሮስና ቅዱስ ጳውሎስ ሆስፒታል የተወጣጡ ዶክተሮች የነጻ ህክምና ካምፔን አደረጉ<br />\n***///<br />\nበዚህ ህክምና 35 ህጻናትና ወላጆቻቸው እንዲሁም በድርጅቱ ውስጥ የሚገኙ ህጻናትና ሰራተኞች በድምሩ ወደ120 ሰዎች ተጠቃሚ ሆነዋል::<br />\nየህክምና ቡድኑ አስተባባሪ ዶ/ር ምስክር ባስተላለፉት መልእክት እንደተናገሩት በእማማ ዘውዱቱ ሥራ መደነቋንና በቀጣይም አብረን ለመስራት ዝግጁ ነን ብለዋል::</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww4.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-896\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww4-300x223.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"223\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww4-300x223.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww4-768x570.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww4-160x120.jpg 160w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww4-24x18.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww4-36x27.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww4-48x36.jpg 48w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww4.jpg 897w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a> <a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-899\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww-225x300.jpg 225w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww-18x24.jpg 18w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww-27x36.jpg 27w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww-36x48.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/zeww.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></a></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>ዛሬ ታህሳስ 24/2014 ዓም በዘውዲቱ መሸሻ የህጻናትና ቤተሰብ መልጃ ማዕከል ውስጥ ከቅዱስ ጴጥሮስና ቅዱስ ጳውሎስ ሆስፒታል የተወጣጡ ዶክተሮች የነጻ ህክምና ካምፔን አደረጉ ***/// በዚህ ህክምና 35 ህጻናትና ወላጆቻቸው እንዲሁም በድርጅቱ ውስጥ የሚገኙ ህጻናትና ሰራተኞች በድምሩ ወደ120 ሰዎች ተጠቃሚ ሆነዋል:: የህክምና ቡድኑ አስተባባሪ ዶ/ር ምስክር ባስተላለፉት መልእክት እንደተናገሩት በእማማ ዘውዱቱ ሥራ መደነቋንና በቀጣይም አብረን ለመስራት ዝግጁ&hellip;</p>\n",
